     "<div dir=\"ltr\">For large phylogenies, the output PDFs can be hard to read.  This can be fixed by increasing the &quot;height&quot; number in the pdf() command.<div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div><div>Nick</div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Flávia Mol</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">flaviam...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Tue, Aug 26, 2014 at 10:07 AM<br>\r\nSubject: Re: problems to see my results - BioGeoBEARS<br>To: Nick Matzke &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mat...@nimbios.org</a>&gt;<br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you so much.<div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">\r\n<div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"></blockquote><span style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Flávia Mól Lanna</b></span><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">\r\n\r\n</blockquote><font size=\"1\">Ciências Biológicas/UFJF</font><div><font size=\"1\">Laboratório de Herpetologia</font><br><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><br></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>\r\n<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2014-08-23 17:42 GMT-03:00 Nick Matzke <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mat...@nimbios.org</a>&gt;</span>:<div><div><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<br>Hi, increase height in the pdf() command. Cheers! Nick<div><div><div><br>On Saturday, August 23, 2014, Flávia Mol &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">flaviam...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\">Dear Nicholas Matzke,</span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI have had some problems to see my results. My tree comprises 418 tips. I will send you a picture (attached) with my problem. Can I get this results from another way?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\">Cheers</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</blockquote><span style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Flávia Mól Lanna</b></span><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"></blockquote><font size=\"1\">Ciências Biológicas/UFJF</font><div><font size=\"1\">Laboratório de Herpetologia</font><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><br></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"></blockquote></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div></div></div><br></div></div>\r\n</div><br></div></div>\r\n"
